<p>The RGB data are printed in the terminal:
</p>
<dl><dd><a href="./File_TCS34725_RPI_Bcm_1.jpg" class="image" title="C example"><img alt="C example" src="../w/upload/thumb/f/f6/TCS34725_RPI_Bcm_1.jpg/500px-TCS34725_RPI_Bcm_1.jpg" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="500" height="137" srcset="../w/upload/f/f6/TCS34725_RPI_Bcm_1.jpg 1.5x" /></a></dd></dl>
