</p>
<div class="panel-group">
				<div class="panel panel-default">
					<div class="panel-heading">
						<h4 class="panel-title">
							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="./TCS34725_Color_Sensor">
								Question: STM32 and Arduino demo serial port output RGB data are all 0 or initialization failed? As shown<br />
</a><a href="./File_TCS34725_Color_Sensor06.png" class="image"><img alt="TCS34725 Color Sensor06.png" src="../w/upload/d/d6/TCS34725_Color_Sensor06.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="345" height="313" /></a><a href="./File_TCS34725_Color_Sensor07.png" class="image"><img alt="TCS34725 Color Sensor07.png" src="../w/upload/1/1b/TCS34725_Color_Sensor07.png" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="400" height="222" /></a>

							
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="accordion6" class="panel-collapse collapse in">
						<div class="panel-body">
<div>&#160;<b>Answer:</b></div>
<div>Please check the hardware connection first, and press the RESET button if there is no problem.
</div>
<div style="display:none;"></div>
<div style="display:none;"></div>
<p><font color="red" style="display:none;">{{{5}}}</font>
</p>
						</div>
					</div>
